# Normalise to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This matters beyond tidiness: Drizzle identifies an applied migration by the
# SHA-256 of its .sql file, so the same migration checked out with CRLF on Windows
# and LF in CI hashes differently and would be applied twice
# (DATABASE_DESIGN.md §7). Closes the .gitattributes item left open by Phase 0b.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sql        text eol=lf
*.json       text eol=lf
*.ts         text eol=lf
*.md         text eol=lf
*.yml        text eol=lf
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
